    },
    {
      "id": "song-966",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "洞仙歌",
      "subtitle": "春残雨过绿暗东",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "春残雨过，绿暗东池道。\n玉艳藏羞媚赪笑。\n记当时、已恨飞镜欢疏，那至此，仍苦题花信少。\n连环情未己，物是人非，月下疏梅似伊好。\n澹秀色，黯寒香，粲若春容，何心顾、闲花凡草。\n但莫使、情随岁华迁，便杳隔秦源，也须能到。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "698f5454fdd22e83d4d58fac1f76bb55185afd2967b094505a13f6d3e0b1181c",
      "estimatedOutput": 816,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-966--698f5454fdd22e83d4d58fac1f76bb55185afd2967b094505a13f6d3e0b1181c.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-967",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "来时杨柳东桥路",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "来时杨柳东桥路。\n曲中暗有相期处。\n明月好因缘。\n欲圆还未圆。\n欲寻芳草去。\n画扇遮微雨。\n飞絮莫无情。\n闲花应笑人。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9c49e0451e3ed42d470b6b7318e7727e622795160d202d7e1ea54a1620c0a190",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-967--9c49e0451e3ed42d470b6b7318e7727e622795160d202d7e1ea54a1620c0a190.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-968",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "个人轻似低飞燕",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "个人轻似低飞燕。\n春来绮陌时相见。\n堪恨两横波。\n恼人情绪多。\n长留青鬓住。\n莫放红颜去。\n占取艳阳天。\n且教伊少年。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "36e171e195058eebb11c66ff82214bada0c100c787ba356eb7807bf8bc24e547",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-968--36e171e195058eebb11c66ff82214bada0c100c787ba356eb7807bf8bc24e547.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-969",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "鸾啼似作留春语",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "鸾啼似作留春语。\n花飞斗学回风舞。\n红日又平西。\n画帘遮燕泥。\n烟光还自老。\n绿镜人空好。\n香在去年衣。\n鱼笺音信稀。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "08f05d3ce30b833763ee3c8046bc39a8685fc27b688c78aca7f103aa14e755f1",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-969--08f05d3ce30b833763ee3c8046bc39a8685fc27b688c78aca7f103aa14e755f1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-970",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "娇香淡染胭脂雪",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "娇香淡染胭脂雪。\n愁春细画弯弯月。\n花月镜边情。\n浅妆匀未成。\n佳期应有在。\n试倚秋千待。\n满地落英红。\n万条杨柳风。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a215a8a00f9aec5e70462e228c4ba6e2ff554f5b289dfa9cd3e2b056b9f31007",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
